// # sec/pqc/pq_sig/ — PQ AEAD Seal/Open
//
// Logline: The PQ AEAD seal that binds ciphertexts to a keypair via
// pk-as-AAD, plus the HMAC + ML-DSA hybrid seal.
//
// Setup: Domain module. Caps and layout are in the parent ANCHOR.oo.
//
// Beats:
//   1. pq_sig.c — orchestrator: PQ AEAD seal/open with pk-as-AAD binding (public API docs).
//   2. pq_aead_seal.c — the encrypt + sign side.
//   3. pq_aead_open.c — the verify + decrypt side.
//   4. pq_hmac.c — the HMAC + ML-DSA hybrid seal.
//
// v3.1.0 file split: the original 460-line pq_sig.c was split into the
// pq_sig/ subdir (4 files; the prior `pq_aead.c` comment-only
// orchestrator was removed in v3.1.0 as 100% comment). The split is
// functional: one algorithm step per file.
//
// ──▓▓ sec/pqc/pq_sig ANCHOR ──▓▓──
